        "exact_text": "I am an art director, and I'm organizing a digital art exhibition called \"FutureScape\". I need a promotional website to showcase the exhibition online. Please generate 6 artwork images: cyberpunk.png, biomechanical.png, interstellar.png, deep_sea.png, quantum_garden.png, time_corridor.png. Create smaller preview versions around 400×300: cyberpunk_thumb.png, biomechanical_thumb.png, interstellar_thumb.png, deep_sea_thumb.png, quantum_garden_thumb.png, time_corridor_thumb.png. Combine all 6 artworks into a wide banner image as banner.jpg.\n",
